      "review_description": "I spoke to four different installers and they were all broadly in the same ballpark as to price and all appeared to offer good quality components (they're are all listed with solar-quotes).  I chose Rimfire because they are an energy retailer and offered 1:1 FIT which I believe suits our requirements better.The sales person was knowledgeable and was able to answer all of my questions immediately and outlined the installation process and timeframes which were all met. The installation was completed in one day and after three months we are very happy with it. Monthly savings on our account are in line with Rimfires projections and we have already built up a healthy credit which we can draw down in cash whenever we wish.  Highly recommended.",
